{"3685570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FIGHT-QUEST", "steam_appid": 3685570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIGHT-QUEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In a colorful and horrific world, take control of a wandering &quot;Hero&quot; who attracts the interest of a powerful and mysterious fairy. Overcome all odds with your fists, and ask questions later.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A first-person rougelite with satisfying brutality -  Stack game-changing enchantments to become unstoppable, discover secrets in lovingly crafted arenas, and extract to a stronghold to overflow it's bank with gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/05757b08c8687ff14c62deb03d817935.poster.avif?t=1782571335\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/05757b08c8687ff14c62deb03d817935.webm?t=1782571335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Gameplay inspired by first-person Soulslike movement and combat<i>,</i> combined with roguelite upgrades and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/d22eb92e90d1cd1c2768035d0b35a384.poster.avif?t=1782571335\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/d22eb92e90d1cd1c2768035d0b35a384.webm?t=1782571335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stack upgrades to become an unstoppable force. Every run offers a unique way to hit things in the face, with the promise of new builds (and new bones) to break. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/917646438f8e92da61e69227a4f035f5.poster.avif?t=1782571335\" width=616 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/extras/917646438f8e92da61e69227a4f035f5.webm?t=1782571335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Extract from arenas and complete quests for gold - Unlock new abilities, arenas, and skins for your next run! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIGHT-QUEST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In a colorful and horrific world, take control of a wandering &quot;Hero&quot; who attracts the interest of a powerful and mysterious fairy. Overcome all odds with your fists, and ask questions later.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A first-person rougelite with satisfying brutality -  Stack game-changing enchantments to become unstoppable, discover secrets in lovingly crafted arenas, and extract to a stronghold to overflow it's bank with gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><spa