35f5.webm?t=1782571335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Extract from arenas and complete quests for gold - Unlock new abilities, arenas, and skins for your next run! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "FIGHT-QUEST is a first-person roguelite where you become an unstoppable &quot;Hero&quot;. Stack game-changing upgrades to slay thousands of fantasy foes, discover sinster secrets in a colorful world, and bank your hard-earned gold.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“A very promising game, with satisfying combat, vibrant visuals and an excellent sense of humor. It turns out punching Gnomes in the face is a hell of a lot of fun!”<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/c8efdb9c6a5ff7c34818bd649c9d263140b66155/header.jpg?t=1782571335", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/d2dad3f837dd7fd4f1150042639f5bb6cc21985e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782571335", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685570/d2dad3f837dd7fd4f1150042639f5bb6cc21985e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782571335", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 or AMD RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Assumes in-game settings are lowered.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Carl Carpenter"], "publishers": ["Carl Carpenter